@host = https://localhost:7089

### Default: page 1, most popular
GET {{host}}/api/anime

### Search
GET {{host}}/api/anime?search=titan

### Filter + sort + small page
GET {{host}}/api/anime?genre=Romance&sort=Score&pageSize=5

### Season filter
GET {{host}}/api/anime?year=2023&season=Fall

### Page 2
GET {{host}}/api/anime?page=2

### Detail
GET {{host}}/api/anime/1

### Missing anime (expect 404)
GET {{host}}/api/anime/999999

### Invalid page size (expect 400)
GET {{host}}/api/anime?pageSize=500

### Invalid sort (expect 400)
GET {{host}}/api/anime?sort=banana

### Genres
GET {{host}}/api/genres

### Import (still here for refreshing data)
POST {{host}}/api/admin/import?pages=4